{"problem_id":"51605ba7-699b-439b-868c-2ba4978c42fe","source_problem_id":"508953","normalized_content":{"assets":[{"alt":"","url":"/assets/08c49381-db95-4790-a261-91a84c6a162a","kind":"ordinary_image","asset_id":"08c49381-db95-4790-a261-91a84c6a162a","asset_key":"image_1"}],"format":"teacherhelper-normalized","sections":[{"key":"condition","html":"<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"08c49381-db95-4790-a261-91a84c6a162a\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/08c49381-db95-4790-a261-91a84c6a162a\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+a\"></span>. Най­ди­те <span data-inline-latex=\"f(\\frac{1}{3})\"></span> .</p>","title":"Условие","asset_keys":["image_1"],"section_id":"condition:1"},{"key":"answer","html":"<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">11</span></p>","title":"Ответ","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"answer:1"},{"key":"solution","html":"<p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  −1, зна­чит, <i>a</i>  =  −1. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(1)  =  3, тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{k}{1}-1=3\\iff k=4\"></span>.  Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(\\frac{1}{3})=\\frac{4}{\\frac{1}{3}}-1=12-1=11\"></span>. </p></center>","title":"Решение","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"solution:1"}],"schema_version":3,"problem_reference_ids":{"prototype_problem_id":null,"group_parent_problem_id":null,"adjacent_group_parent_problem_id":null}}}
